The patch addresses the memory leak vulnerability by implementing two key changes across all kadmind server stubs:

**Change 1: Variable Initialization and Unified Cleanup**
<enforcement spec="HS-MEM-003">
<location>kadmin/server/server_stubs.c, all server stub functions</location>
