By enforcing **HS-INPUT-001**, the fix also indirectly enforces **HS-MEM-002**. Once coordinates are normalized at the entry point, the recursive calls are only ever made with coordinates that are within or adjacent to the currently processed image region, preventing uncontrolled depth.

