    <compliance_mechanism>
        The fix eliminates the stack variable `old_desc` entirely, removing the possibility of exposing uninitialized stack memory. By not declaring `old_desc` on the stack, it ensures no kernel stack data can be leaked to the guest, even in error conditions.
