    <compliance_mechanism>
        The fix adds an explicit bounds check before inserting the page into the page cache. It reads the current i_size, converts it to huge page units using `>> huge_page_shift(h)`, and verifies that the target index `idx` is within bounds (`idx < size`). If the check fails, it returns `-EFAULT` to user-space, preventing the out-of-bounds insertion.
