**Change 2: Atomic i_size Revalidation After Page Table Lock**
<enforcement spec="HS-STATE-002">
<location>mm/hugetlb.c, hugetlb_mcopy_atomic_pte()</location>
<diff>
 	ptl = huge_pte_lockptr(h, dst_mm, dst_pte);
