+    }
</diff>
    <compliance_mechanism>
        The fix adds explicit logging and error handling for base64 decoding operations. While the primary buffer overflow fix is architectural, this change ensures that the `b64_pton` function is called with the correct buffer size (`bufsize`), which is calculated as `wsctx->codeBufDecode + ARRAYSIZE(wsctx->codeBufDecode) - wsctx->writePos - 1`. This prevents overflow of the internal `codeBufDecode` buffer.
